flowchart LR
  U[Uploaded file] --> C[Canonicalize columns and row order]
  C --> H[Compute hashes]
  H --> V[Validate schema pairing and units]
  V -->|blocking issue| Fix[User fixes input]
  Fix --> U
  V -->|ready| Run[Immutable audit run]
  Run --> Results[Module results and verdict]
  Results --> Trail[Audit trail]
  Trail --> Export[Exports]
  Trail --> Retain[Retention policy]
  Retain --> Delete[Deletion or archive]

